WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
Counselors can be helpful for two big reasons.

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:06.960
First, they give you a private place to talk about your thoughts, feelings, actions, and

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:07.960
friendships.

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:12.040
Having someone to talk to can help you feel better and get things off your mind.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:17.320
Second, counselors can also be helpful because they teach you skills to use every day.

00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:20.920
Sometimes these are ways to talk better or no ways to think.

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.480
Other times they are things you can do by yourself.

00:00:23.480 --> 00:00:25.839
In Renew, we will show you one of these skills.

00:00:25.839 --> 00:00:30.399
It's called Progressive Muscle Relaxation, or PMR for short.

00:00:30.399 --> 00:00:33.119
You can do this on your own or a counselor can help you learn how.

